{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "authentik",
  "abstract": "Open-source identity provider and SSO platform for self-hosting, built around configurable flows and stages. Acts as an OpenID Connect (OpenID Certified), OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, WS-Federation, LDAP, RADIUS and SCIM provider, and can federate from LDAP, Active Directory, Kerberos, SAML, OAuth and social sources. Policies written in Python, an application proxy and a Terraform provider cover customization and automation. The core is MIT licensed, with an Enterprise edition adding Privileged Access Management, Entra ID and Google Workspace sync, mTLS and extended audit features. There is no hosted offering.",
